{"title":"1992 AJHSME Problems/Problem 6","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Suppose that \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/d/36dbd276ddba01c938b762addfb0e4d14c555db2.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy]  unitsize(18); draw((0,0)--(2,0)--(1,sqrt(3))--cycle); label(&quot;$a$&quot;,(1,sqrt(3)-0.2),S); label(&quot;$b$&quot;,(sqrt(3)/10,0.1),ENE); label(&quot;$c$&quot;,(2-sqrt(3)/10,0.1),WNW); [/asy]\" width=\"62\" height=\"55\" />\nmeans <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/a/5da36b2ecd0539d6f534b4c65e2fe3b0ee8bef5d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a+b-c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"70\" height=\"14\" />.\nFor example, \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/7/f/87fa64329d26c5fc3e7fbfb572d479dbef63ae93.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] unitsize(18); draw((0,0)--(2,0)--(1,sqrt(3))--cycle); label(&quot;$5$&quot;,(1,sqrt(3)-0.2),S); label(&quot;$4$&quot;,(sqrt(3)/10,0.1),ENE); label(&quot;$6$&quot;,(2-sqrt(3)/10,0.1),WNW); [/asy]\" width=\"62\" height=\"55\" />\nis <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/e/0/2e0fe105b428b157046b05c7d1dc785fe51dac47.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5+4-6 = 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"104\" height=\"14\" />.\nThen the sum \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/a/c/6ace4445c995cc99d66def7ca3e0d5cefe90b775.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] unitsize(18); draw((0,0)--(2,0)--(1,sqrt(3))--cycle); label(&quot;$1$&quot;,(1,sqrt(3)-0.2),S); label(&quot;$3$&quot;,(sqrt(3)/10,0.1),ENE); label(&quot;$4$&quot;,(2-sqrt(3)/10,0.1),WNW); draw((3,0)--(5,0)--(4,sqrt(3))--cycle); label(&quot;$2$&quot;,(4,sqrt(3)-0.2),S); label(&quot;$5$&quot;,(3+sqrt(3)/10,0.1),ENE); label(&quot;$6$&quot;,(5-sqrt(3)/10,0.1),WNW); label(&quot;$+$&quot;,(2.5,-0.1),N); [/asy]\" width=\"152\" height=\"55\" />\nis\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/3/1/531094282cc845a04ca6e9ba5c670ccea5bfb7e1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)}\\ -2 \\qquad \\text{(B)}\\ -1 \\qquad \\text{(C)}\\ 0 \\qquad \\text{(D)}\\ 1 \\qquad \\text{(E)}\\ 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"377\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The first triangle represents <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/b/2/3b295116adb50bac8acfe11177e68e8d6326beea.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1+3-4 = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"107\" height=\"15\" />, and the 2nd triangle represents <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/b/6/2b66d728ea3247a6d7fe38b5eaa27ee28386fc68.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2+5-6 = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"107\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><br />\nSince we have to add the 2 triangles together, the final answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, which is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/4/b/94bf9089f3c0ad5ee9fca030cfb06b487e559902.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\text{D}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"24\" height=\"23\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AJHSME\" title=\"1992 AJHSME\">1992 AJHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AJHSME_Problems\" title=\"1992 AJHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AJHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1992 AJHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=42&amp;year=1992\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1992 AJHSME Problems/Problem 5\">Problem 5</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1992 AJHSME Problems/Problem 7\">Problem 7</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1992 AJHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1992 AJHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1992 AJHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1992 AJHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1992 AJHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1992 AJHS